  "body": "deleting a picture from the queue while the queue is shortly locked (jxl export), the wrong picture wil be deleted.\n\nObviously is the queue while exporting jxl shortly (10-20 seconds locked). This  was the time, where sorting items crashed ART. That is now working. But when i delete a picture from the queue while the queue is locked, then the wrong picture is deleted. It is the picture, which is right from the picture i want to delete.\n\nI think, after delocking the queue all pictures go one step to the left and the click on the delete is executed on the place where the other picture was, but there is now the picture left from the picture i want to delete, so i killed the wrong picture. Thats dangerous ...\n\nThank you",
